<title>SWEDEN: Netcom says planning to list in 1997.</title>
<headline>Netcom says planning to list in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish computer company Netcom said on Friday it would probably list its shares on Nasdaq in the U.S. in the first half of 1997.  </p>
<p>&quot;If (the listing) will happen, it will happen this half year,&quot; said Netcom's president Anders Bjorkman told reporters.</p>
<p>&quot;I cannot see any reason why we would not do it.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
